<section id="A1.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.4 </span>Annotator Change Percentages by Field</h3>

<div id="A1.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ A.4 Annotator Change Percentages by Field ‣ Appendix A Candidate Data Details ‣ VideoNorms: Benchmarking Cultural Awareness of Video Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> shows percentages of changes per field by U.S. and Chinese annotators.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T9" class="ltx_table">
<div id="A1.T9.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:211.0pt;height:121.2pt;vertical-align:-58.1pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(0.0pt,0.0pt) scale(1,1) ;">
<p id="A1.T9.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T9.2.1.1" class="ltx_text">
